*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FEE0012
*> PURPOSE : FEE EXEMPTIONS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : A.W.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-05-18 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-10-05 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 351
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FEENIGHT STEP020
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FEE0012.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    05 STUDENT-IND        PIC X.
    *> CUSTOMER AGE IN YEARS
    05 CLNT-AGE           PIC 9(3).
    05 POST-DATE          PIC 9(8).
    05 POST-DATE-R REDEFINES POST-DATE.
       10 POST-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 POST-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 POST-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(6).
01 WS-RESULTS.
    *> FEE WAIVER INDICATOR
    05 FEE-WAIVER-FLG     PIC X VALUE 'N'.
        88 FEE-WAIVED VALUE 'Y'.
    *> MONTHLY SERVICE FEE
    05 MONTHLY-FEE        PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM FEE-CONCESSION
    DISPLAY "FEE-WAIVER-FLG=" FEE-WAIVER-FLG
    DISPLAY "MONTHLY-FEE=" MONTHLY-FEE
    STOP RUN.
FEE-CONCESSION.
    *> STUDENT FEE WAIVER
    IF STUDENT-IND = 'Y' AND CLNT-AGE < 26
        SET FEE-WAIVED TO TRUE
        MOVE 0 TO MONTHLY-FEE
    ELSE
        *> SENIOR FEE WAIVER
        IF CLNT-AGE >= 65
            SET FEE-WAIVED TO TRUE
            MOVE 0 TO MONTHLY-FEE
        ELSE
            MOVE 9 TO MONTHLY-FEE
        END-IF
    END-IF.
